{
  "title": "Set Up Your Store: From a New Site to a First Sale | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A new store takes a few steps before its first sale. The CrestApps setup guide lists them in order and does the simple ones for you: your store's details and currency, how customers pay, where you ship, tax, a first product and a test order, and roles for your staff, on the Online store recipe with the Storefront theme.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why a setup guide, and starting a new store with the Online store recipe\n• Opening the guide: steps, ticks and the progress bar\n• Your store's details and currency\n• Taking card payments and bank transfers\n• Shipping everywhere at one rate, and skipping tax\n• Adding a first product and placing a test order\n• Roles for your staff\n• The Storefront theme",
